  #exercise[The Lie algebra $hat(frak(n))^+$ of
    Problem~@pr:triangular-decomposition-g-hat is freely generated by the
    elements $hat(e)_1, ..., hat(e)_l$ (i.e. there exists an isomorphism
    $frak(l)(x_1, ..., x_l) -> hat(frak(n))^+$ sending $x_i$ to $hat(e)_i$).
    Similarly, $hat(frak(n))^-$ is freely generated by
